%;\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E4%BC%BD%E8%8F%88%E6%B3%A2%E9%82%A3\" title=\"伽菈波那\"><img alt=\"伽菈波那\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c3/HeadIconSmall-307001.png/100px-HeadIconSmall-307001.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"img-fit\" srcset=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/c/c3/HeadIconSmall-307001.png 1.5x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></a></span></span></span><span class=\"tooltips\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E4%BC%BD%E8%8F%88%E6%B3%A2%E9%82%A3\" title=\"伽菈波那\">伽菈波那</a></span></span></div><div><div><span class=\"color-darkgold\" style=\"margin-right:1em\">实装版本：</span>3.2</div></div><div><div><span class=\"color-darkgold\" style=\"margin-right:3em\">来源：</span>银行</div></div><div><div><span class=\"color-darkgold\" style=\"margin-right:1em\">所属系列：</span>反时代浪潮</div></div><div><div class=\"grey-small test-hide hide-m\">编号ID：307004</div></div></div></div><div class=\"skin-video tabber\"><h2><span id=\".E8.A7.86.E9.A2.91.E9.A2.84.E8.A7.88\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"视频预览\">视频预览</span></h2><div class=\"tabber-filter\" style=\"margin:0 -3px 4px -3px\"><div class=\"tabber-filter-item filter-button selected\" data-type=\"videoId\" data-videoid=\"4\">1技能</div><div class=\"tabber-filter-item filter-button\" data-type=\"videoId\" data-videoid=\"3\">2技能</div><div class=\"tabber-filter-item filter-button\" data-type=\"videoId\" data-videoid=\"2\">大招</div><div class=\"tabber-filter-item filter-button\" data-type=\"videoId\" data-videoid=\"1\">入场</div></div><div class=\"skin-video--single tabber-item\" data-videoid=\"4\" data-videourl=\"https&#58;//notice-res.sl916.com/skinVideo/50001/3070/307004/1技能.mp4\" data-backgroundurl=\"https&#58;//notice-res.sl916.com/skinVideo/50001/3070/307004/1技能 - frame at 0m0s.jpg\"></div><div class=\"skin-video--single tabber-item\" data-videoid=\"3\" data-videourl=\"https&#58;//notice-res.sl916.com/skinVideo/50001/3070/307004/2技能.mp4\" data-backgroundurl=\"https&#58;//notice-res.sl916.com/skinVideo/50001/3070/307004/2技能 - frame at 0m0s.jpg\" style=\"display:none\"></div><div class=\"skin-video--single tabber-item\" data-videoid=\"2\" data-videourl=\"https&#58;//notice-res.sl916.com/skinVideo/50001/3070/307004/大招.mp4\" data-backgroundurl=\"https&#58;//notice-res.sl916.com/skinVideo/50001/3070/307004/大招 - frame at 0m0s.jpg\" style=\"display:none\"></div><div class=\"skin-video--single tabber-item\" data-videoid=\"1\" data-videourl=\"https&#58;//notice-res.sl916.com/skinVideo/50001/3070/307004/入场.mp4\" data-backgroundurl=\"https&#58;//notice-res.sl916.com/skinVideo/50001/3070/307004/入场 - frame at 0m0s.jpg\" style=\"display:none\"></div></div><h2><span id=\".E7.AA.97.E4.B8.AD.E4.BE.A7.E5.86.99_Garment_Display\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"窗中侧写_Garment_Display\">窗中侧写<small style=\"color: grey\"> <span style=\"display:inline-block\">Garment Display</span></small></span></h2><div class=\"infopad\">罗睺吞下了太阳，但那颗滚烫的火球，仍旧在祂的喉咙中灼烧。<br />她回到了简塔·曼塔天文台，这个地方发生过太多的故事。星空也许能够让灵魂徜徉，却不能治愈现实的痼疾——无论发生了什么，星空依旧永恒，旧日的伤痛也一样。<br />所有目光短浅之人都无法看到她所描绘的那颗星子，倘若星子取代了头顶的太阳，众人应作何表情？<br />这是一次出乎意料的日蚀，就好像某位隐居于暗物质中的神明挪动了星辰的位置一样，所有的仪器均未检测出先兆。巨大的天体高悬于顶，火红的余光照亮了大地。<br />当所有仪器和眼球都被这诡异的红光灼烧时，她静静坐在天文台顶端巨大的黑色掌心中，而那颗星子已经落进了她的瞳孔中。</div><div id=\"崭新单品\"></div><h2><span id=\".E5.B4.AD.E6.96.B0.E5.8D.95.E5.93.81_All-new_Item\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"崭新单品_All-new_Item\">崭新单品<small style=\"color: grey\"> <span style=\"display:inline-block\">All-new Item</span></small></span></h2><div class=\"char-item-box0 tabber\"><div class=\"char-item-box1 tabber-item\" data-skinid=\"307004\"><div class=\"char-item-box2\"><div style=\"margin: 0 -20px;\"><div class=\"char-item-img\"><img alt=\"Belonging-307007.png\" src=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/0/01/Belonging-307007.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"484\" height=\"444\" class=\"img-fit\" data-file-width=\"484\" data-file-height=\"444\" /><div class=\"title\">挽星之手<div class=\"grey-small\" style=\"text-wrap:wrap\">The Celestial Hand</div></div></div><div>无估值<hr style=\"margin:6px 0 10px 0; clear:both\" /></div><div>彩绘在手臂上的星辰纹样，似乎散发着奇异的神秘学气息。<br />据受访者言，彩绘纹饰以护卫身躯是吠陀的古老技法。然而本社必须声明，一切用身体承载术阵的行为均有较高的风险，尤其是这款看起来能够召唤日食的不祥纹样。</div></div></div><div class=\"char-item-box2\"><div style=\"margin: 0 -20px;\"><div class=\"char-item-img\"><img alt=\"Belonging-307008.png\" src=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/4/4e/Belonging-307008.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"484\" height=\"444\" class=\"img-fit\" data-file-width=\"484\" data-file-height=\"444\" /><div class=\"title\">蔽日纱袍<div class=\"grey-small\" style=\"text-wrap:wrap\">Shawl of the Fallen Sun</div></div></div><div><img alt=\"雨滴\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/bb/Value-1.png/27px-Value-1.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"雨滴\" width=\"27\" height=\"18\" style=\"vertical-align: text-bottom\" srcset=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/b/bb/Value-1.png 1.5x\" data-file-width=\"36\" data-file-height=\"24\" />71<div class=\"grey-small\" style=\"float: right;\">信任达到60%解锁</div><hr style=\"margin:6px 0 10px 0; clear:both\" /></div><div>织有星辰及日食形象的纱袍，如夜幕般轻盈，并非传统款式。<br />受访者慷慨地阐释了纱袍上所示的内容，那是一个神谕，讲述了太阳永恒熄灭后，蓝色的大星降临世间的未来。笔者对预言并不当真，但受访者安宁平和的表情着实令人感到不安。</div></div></div><div class=\"char-item-box2\"><div style=\"margin: 0 -20px;\"><div class=\"char-item-img\"><img alt=\"Belonging-307009.png\" src=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/f/f5/Belonging-307009.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"484\" height=\"444\" class=\"img-fit\" data-file-width=\"484\" data-file-height=\"444\" /><div class=\"title\">罗睺之蚀<div class=\"grey-small\" style=\"text-wrap:wrap\">Rahu's Demise</div></div></div><div><img alt=\"雨滴\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/bb/Value-1.png/27px-Value-1.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"雨滴\" width=\"27\" height=\"18\" style=\"vertical-align: text-bottom\" srcset=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/b/bb/Value-1.png 1.5x\" data-file-width=\"36\" data-file-height=\"24\" />1392<div class=\"grey-small\" style=\"float: right;\">信任达到100%解锁</div><hr style=\"margin:6px 0 10px 0; clear:both\" /></div><div>象征太阳光辉的耳饰，其间串起的链条可视为对日食过程的一种阐释。<br />我们从受访者处得知了有关名为罗睺的阿修罗追逐吞食日月以致蚀变的传说。尽管从现代天文学的角度来说，这种“影响其他星体的不可见星体”纯属无稽之谈，但谁知道呢，世界总能给出出人意料的答案。</div></div></div></div></div><h2><span id=\".E8.A1.A3.E7.9D.80.E6.B5.B7.E6.8A.A5\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"衣着海报\">衣着海报</span></h2><div style=\"display:flex; gap:10px; border:1px solid #b55829; width:fit-content\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E5%A4%AA%E9%98%B3%E4%BD%95%E6%97%B6%E7%9E%91%E7%9B%AE1.jpg\" class=\"image\"><img alt=\"衣着 太阳何时瞑目1.jpg\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/1b/%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E5%A4%AA%E9%98%B3%E4%BD%95%E6%97%B6%E7%9E%91%E7%9B%AE1.jpg/228px-%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E5%A4%AA%E9%98%B3%E4%BD%95%E6%97%B6%E7%9E%91%E7%9B%AE1.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"228\" height=\"325\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/1b/%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E5%A4%AA%E9%98%B3%E4%BD%95%E6%97%B6%E7%9E%91%E7%9B%AE1.jpg/342px-%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E5%A4%AA%E9%98%B3%E4%BD%95%E6%97%B6%E7%9E%91%E7%9B%AE1.jpg 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/1b/%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E5%A4%AA%E9%98%B3%E4%BD%95%E6%97%B6%E7%9E%91%E7%9B%AE1.jpg/456px-%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E5%A4%AA%E9%98%B3%E4%BD%95%E6%97%B6%E7%9E%91%E7%9B%AE1.jpg 2x\" data-file-width=\"1080\" data-file-height=\"1540\" /></a><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E5%A4%AA%E9%98%B3%E4%BD%95%E6%97%B6%E7%9E%91%E7%9B%AE2.jpg\" class=\"image\"><img alt=\"衣着 太阳何时瞑目2.jpg\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/83/%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E5%A4%AA%E9%98%B3%E4%BD%95%E6%97%B6%E7%9E%91%E7%9B%AE2.jpg/228px-%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E5%A4%AA%E9%98%B3%E4%BD%95%E6%97%B6%E7%9E%91%E7%9B%AE2.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"228\" height=\"325\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/83/%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E5%A4%AA%E9%98%B3%E4%BD%95%E6%97%B6%E7%9E%91%E7%9B%AE2.jpg/342px-%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E5%A4%AA%E9%98%B3%E4%BD%95%E6%97%B6%E7%9E%91%E7%9B%AE2.jpg 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/83/%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E5%A4%AA%E9%98%B3%E4%BD%95%E6%97%B6%E7%9E%91%E7%9B%AE2.jpg/456px-%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E5%A4%AA%E9%98%B3%E4%BD%95%E6%97%B6%E7%9E%91%E7%9B%AE2.jpg 2x\" data-file-width=\"1080\" data-file-height=\"1540\" /></a></div></div></div>", "categories": [{"sortkey": "", "category": "衣着"}], "displaytitle": "<span style=\"display:inline-block\"><span style=\"display: flex;flex-direction: column;\">太阳何时瞑目 <small style=\"color: grey\">Till the Sun Falls</small></span></span>"}}